Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Rover: add Auto DO_LAND_START or RTL failsafe action

Adds FailsafeAction 7 for FS_ACTION, the battery failsafe actions and
FENCE_ACTION. On failsafe the vehicle jumps to the nearest DO_LAND_START
in the mission and continues in Auto, so a user-planned return route is
driven. If there is no DO_LAND_START it falls back to RTL, then Hold.

Auto now accepts DO_LAND_START as a marker instead of skipping it as an
invalid command.

Fixes #8503

